--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5acf2cf32a9b1134ea7a8b6ad6b27ae6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuacxiconSO
  categories:
  - categoryName: Tutorial
    contentList:
    - Whew! I am so glad you finally made it!
    - "You know, If you didn\u2019t show up, I\u2019d have to hunt you down haha!"
    - "Anyway, I\u2019m glad we can have you."
    - "Just take one look at this place it\u2019s obvious we need the help."
    - But let me show you around, so that this can be a smooth transition.
    - "You wouldn\u2019t want to end up like the last mayor, am I right?!"
    - "You don\u2019t. I wouldn\u2019t recommend it."
    - But lets get on with it.
    - This is your calendar.
    - You know what a calendar is right?
    - "Well if you don\u2019t it shows you the day it is of course!"
    - "If you want to know how much time you have until the next month just look
      at this bar right here. Once the bar is full it\u2019s time to move on!"
    - However, if you ever get one of those days where you feel like time is just
      dragging on just use this fast forward to kick things up a notch.
    - If you even feel like you need time to think then you can also use this to
      have things come to a full stop.
    - "Whenever you\u2019re ready to come back just use this to continue where you
      left off."
    - "You\u2019re not the only one who will get moody around here you know."
    - "If you\u2019re gonna be the major you have to take care of us which means
      giving us things that will make us happy."
    - This stat right here tells you the happiness of all of the ducks in your land.
    - Sometimes how a duck feels will be obvious, so obvious that it will just show
      up above their heads.
    - But if you ever want to see what is specifically  bothering a duck just click
      on them for more information!
    - When you click on a duck you will be able to see their individual happiness
      and hunger levels.
    - How do you make us happy you ask?
    - "Well that\u2019s easy! You give us more stuff to do!"
    - This right here shows you all the buildings that can be created to spruce up
      the place.
    - "You like it? I can\u2019t wait to see what it would look like in person."
    - "Each build has a requirement that will benefit our \u201Clovely\u201D community.
      Each build costs a certain amount of crumbies so don\u2019t get too trigger
      happy."
    - If you ever want to know the crumbs of the community that is my specialty.
    - Here is a journal, I will make sure to keep you updated on all the things going
      on. From boring political news to juicy gossip!
    - Hover over it and you have a choice of either the newspaper or my trusty notepad.
    - If you want the boring stuff just click the newspaper, it will tell you all
      of the developments that you and the community have done.
    - But if you want something more interesting just check out my notepad. I have
      ears everywhere.
    - That should be everything! I should be around if you ever need a refresher.
    - "Good luck boss, and remember I\u2019m watching you."
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ec6b39934239aeb4fa1790df476d6e9e, type: 3}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
